MARKET AREA OVERVIEW
The subject is located in East Cheyenne at the corner of E.Lincolnway and Cleveland Ave/ Greenway St.
Across the street to the north is Meridian Trust FCU, Outlaw liquors and Pour Decisions Bar&Grill.Across
the street to the west is Fitness Oneand just north of that isthenew Dollar General Store and Whispering
Chase Assisted Senior Living.
In general, the area to the east and south of the subject is residential in nature while the area along E.
